  lessonTitle: "The Ten Bridesmaids",
  passage: "Matthew 25:1–13",
  bigIdea: "Jesus will come again, and it will be a joyful wedding feast — so be ready by keeping your own faith alive, because nobody else can be ready for you.",
  godIs: "Coming Again",
